alse","unknown"]}},"required":["conditionId","value"],"additionalProperties":false}},"effect":{"type":"string","enum":["reachable","blocked","unknown"]},"explanation":{"type":"string"},"missingFacts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"factIds":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"required":["id","assumptions","effect","explanation","missingFacts","factIds"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["obligationId","explanation","facts","decisiveMissingFacts","suggestedObservations","decision","branchResults"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["results"],"additionalProperties":false}]},"usage":{"input":5345,"output":1350,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"transportAttempts":"unknown","response":{"text":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_t83RtQMtqzXYhBKdkphK2IUz","name":"submit_authorization_result","arguments":{"results":[{"obligationId":"scenario%3Atoken-status-unspecified::entry%3Aget-shared","decision":{"kind":"observed","observed":"unknown"},"branchResults":[],"explanation":"At the declared entry, the handler documents that no authentication is required and first resolves the supplied share token. If that resolution returns a non-expired share, the handler binds the protected memo to the share's MemoID, rejects missing, non-normal, or SPACE-audience memos, and evaluates read access with that same shared memo ID. Under the stated premise that the resolved memo is active, private, non-SPACE, and has a valid creator, the share-specific access condition applies and the private memo is allowed; the handler then returns the converted memo with Parent cleared. If the token is absent or expired, active-share resolution returns NOT_FOUND before memo retrieval. An inaccessible memo visible in this entry is likewise returned as NOT_FOUND after the read-context check; missing, non-normal, or SPACE-audience memos are also returned as NOT_FOUND. Because token existence and expiry are unspecified, the fixed source supports both the successful conditional path and the NOT_FOUND path, so no single concrete observed outcome can be selected. No separate requested memo identity is introduced or assumed.","facts":[{"id":"f-entry","kind":"entry","statement":"GetSharedMemo is the analyzed handler, and its source-visible contract says authentication is not required; it begins by resolving the supplied share token.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-e4f8cd24172048ad","startLine":170,"endLine":173}]},{"id":"f-token-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"After active-share resolution, the handler retrieves the memo using the share record's MemoID and passes that same ID into read-context construction.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-e4f8cd24172048ad","startLine":178,"endLine":186}]},{"id":"f-anonymous-context","kind":"binding","statement":"The read-context helper obtains the current viewer and permits an anonymous viewer to be represented when no current user is present; the task premise supplies that the caller is anonymous.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-4715f0667b50b99d","startLine":17,"endLine":29}]},{"id":"f-share-control","kind":"control","statement":"The strongest visible share-specific authorization condition applies when the context shared ID equals the memo ID and the memo is not SPACE-audience; that condition returns an allowed private-read class.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-5680870821a0e984","startLine":119,"endLine":121}]},{"id":"f-entry-filter","kind":"condition","statement":"The handler treats a missing memo, any non-normal memo, or a SPACE-audience memo as NOT_FOUND before read authorization.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-e4f8cd24172048ad","startLine":182,"endLine":185}]},{"id":"f-inaccessible-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"A read-context error or a disallowed memo-read decision produces a NOT_FOUND response.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-e4f8cd24172048ad","startLine":186,"endLine":188}]},{"id":"f-success-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"After successful access checks and conversion, the handler returns the memo and clears Parent, limiting the shared result to the associated memo rather than its surrounding graph.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-e4f8cd24172048ad","startLine":203,"endLine":213}]},{"id":"f-invalid-expired-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"Active-share resolution returns NOT_FOUND when the share lookup yields no record or the resolved share is expired.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-e4f8cd24172048ad","startLine":217,"endLine":229}]},{"id":"f-private-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"For a private memo, ordinary anonymous access would be denied, but the share-specific condition is evaluated before the visibility switch and supplies the allowed path when its exact memo binding holds.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-5680870821a0e984","startLine":119,"endLine":121},{"sourceId":"src-5680870821a0e984","startLine":138,"endLine":145}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":["Whether the supplied share token resolves to a share record rather than nil.","Whether the resolved share is expired at evaluation time."],"suggestedObservations":["Observe the result of getActiveMemoShare for the supplied token, including whether the returned share is nil and, if non-nil, whether isMemoShareExpired is true or false."]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":5345,"output":1350,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":86071.1373,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-29T15:15:07.953Z"}}
