":["true","false","unknown"]}},"required":["conditionId","value"],"additionalProperties":false}},"effect":{"type":"string","enum":["reachable","blocked","unknown"]},"explanation":{"type":"string"},"missingFacts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"factIds":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"required":["id","assumptions","effect","explanation","missingFacts","factIds"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["obligationId","explanation","facts","decisiveMissingFacts","suggestedObservations","decision","branchResults"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["results"],"additionalProperties":false}]},"usage":{"input":6798,"output":1361,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"transportAttempts":"unknown","response":{"text":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_7iwBcxXfmYmAk1caOEP8bevj","name":"submit_authorization_result","arguments":{"results":[{"obligationId":"scenario%3Atoken-status-unspecified::entry%3Aget-shared","decision":{"kind":"conditional-policy","policyStatus":"satisfied"},"branchResults":[],"explanation":"At the declared entry, GetSharedMemo requires no authentication and first resolves the supplied token. If the token resolves to a non-expired share, the handler binds the protected memo to that share's MemoID and supplies the same MemoID to the read-access context. Under the task premises—not as independently established runtime facts—the associated memo is active, private, non-SPACE, and has a valid creator. On that conditional path, the exact-memo share check applies before the ordinary private-visibility rule and allows the read; after conversion, the handler returns that memo with Parent cleared. If the token does not resolve, or if it resolves to an expired share, active-share resolution returns NOT_FOUND before memo retrieval. Within the specified entry, a missing, non-normal, or SPACE-audience memo returns NOT_FOUND, and a read-context error or disallowed read decision also returns NOT_FOUND. These source-visible branches conform to the accepted conditional policy. However, the current invocation's concrete outcome remains undetermined because the premises do not establish whether the supplied token exists or is unexpired. No separate requested memo identity or deployment outcome is assumed.","facts":[{"id":"f-entry","kind":"entry","statement":"GetSharedMemo is the analyzed handler; its source-visible contract states that authentication is not required, and it begins by resolving the supplied share token.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-e4f8cd24172048ad","startLine":170,"endLine":173}]},{"id":"f-principal-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The read-context helper obtains the current viewer and handles the case in which no current user is present; the caller's anonymity is supplied by the task premise rather than established as a runtime observation.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-4715f0667b50b99d","startLine":17,"endLine":29}]},{"id":"f-resource-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"After active-share resolution, the handler retrieves the memo identified by the share record's MemoID and passes that same MemoID into read-context construction.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-e4f8cd24172048ad","startLine":178,"endLine":186}]},{"id":"f-share-control","kind":"control","statement":"The decisive share-specific authorization check applies only when the shared memo ID equals the memo ID and the memo is not SPACE-audience; when it applies, it returns an allowed private-read class.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-5680870821a0e984","startLine":119,"endLine":121}]},{"id":"f-private-fallback","kind":"condition","statement":"Absent the earlier exact-memo share allowance, the ordinary private-memo branch denies an inactive or anonymous viewer, showing that the allowed path is specifically provided by the matching share binding.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-5680870821a0e984","startLine":138,"endLine":145}]},{"id":"f-entry-filter","kind":"condition","statement":"The handler returns NOT_FOUND before the read check when the associated memo is missing, non-normal, or SPACE-audience.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-e4f8cd24172048ad","startLine":182,"endLine":185}]},{"id":"f-inaccessible-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"A read-context error or a disallowed memo-read decision returns NOT_FOUND.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-e4f8cd24172048ad","startLine":186,"endLine":188}]},{"id":"f-success-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"After successful access checks and conversion, the handler clears Parent and returns the associated memo, limiting the shared response to that memo rather than its surrounding relation graph.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-e4f8cd24172048ad","startLine":203,"endLine":213}]},{"id":"f-expiry-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"A share is expired when it has an expiration timestamp earlier than the evaluation time.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-e4f8cd24172048ad","startLine":217,"endLine":219}]},{"id":"f-invalid-expired-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"Active-share resolution looks up the supplied token and returns NOT_FOUND when no share record exists or when the resolved share is expired.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-e4f8cd24172048ad","startLine":221,"endLine":229}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":["Whether the supplied share token resolves to a share record rather than no record.","Whether a resolved share is unexpired at evaluation time."],"suggestedObservations":["Observe the result of active-share resolution for the supplied token: whether lookup returns a share record and, if so, whether its expiration check reports expired or unexpired."]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":6798,"output":1361,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":26388.940200000012,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-29T15:15:34.348Z"}}
